{"unit_id":"JuwanXu__dsh-camel#card-zh","repo":"JuwanXu/dsh-camel","commit":"fbb445c2e92ad233adbf4ba013fc04ad39ba6996","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-camel（DSH 插件，适用于 DSH 支持的客户端）：为模型请求提供可配置的限流节奏控制和 RATE_LIMIT 错误恢复。它在 agent 的模型请求与重试流程中接入策略控制，并提供可选的 /camel 任务命令。主要功能包括按 provider/model 学习配额并自适应调整请求频率、固定滑动窗口节流、尊重 Retry-After 的等待与有界或持续重试，以及查看状态、暂停、恢复和设置任务级策略。适合经常遇到模型服务限流、希望减少请求过快并自动等待恢复的 DSH 用户。默认策略均关闭；按需在插件 defaults 中配置，命令服务可选。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:21","src/runtime.ts:1","src/commands.ts:25","src/adaptive.ts:24"]}
{"unit_id":"JuwanXu__dsh-camel#card-en","repo":"JuwanXu/dsh-camel","commit":"fbb445c2e92ad233adbf4ba013fc04ad39ba6996","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-camel is a DSH plugin for rate-limit pacing and retry recovery. It adds provider/model quota learning, fixed throttling, Retry-After-aware waits, bounded or unlimited retries, and task-level status and pause controls to model requests. Its policies are disabled by default.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:21","src/runtime.ts:1","src/commands.ts:25","src/adaptive.ts:24"]}
{"unit_id":"JuwanXu__dsh-camel#intent-1","repo":"JuwanXu/dsh-camel","commit":"fbb445c2e92ad233adbf4ba013fc04ad39ba6996","type":"intent","lang":"zh","text":"想让 DSH 遇到模型限流时自动等待后重试。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/retry.ts:8"]}
