{"unit_id":"JuwanXu__dsh-camel#intent-4","repo":"JuwanXu/dsh-camel","commit":"fbb445c2e92ad233adbf4ba013fc04ad39ba6996","type":"intent","lang":"zh","text":"希望在当前任务里暂停或恢复自动限流处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/commands.ts:25"]}
