{"unit_id":"JuwanXu__dsh-camel#intent-6","repo":"JuwanXu/dsh-camel","commit":"fbb445c2e92ad233adbf4ba013fc04ad39ba6996","type":"intent","lang":"en","text":"Can DSH learn separate request limits for each provider and model?","source":"generated","evidence":["src/adaptive.ts:27"]}
{"unit_id":"JuwanXu__dsh-camel#feature-1","repo":"JuwanXu/dsh-camel","commit":"fbb445c2e92ad233adbf4ba013fc04ad39ba6996","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-camel 的功能「自适应配额节奏」：按准确的 provider/model 路由学习请求额度，遇到限流时降低额度，在连续干净窗口后逐步提高；可在配置中设置上下限和窗口。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/adaptive.ts:24"]}
{"unit_id":"JuwanXu__dsh-camel#feature-2","repo":"JuwanXu/dsh-camel","commit":"fbb445c2e92ad233adbf4ba013fc04ad39ba6996","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-camel 的功能「固定请求节流」：通过滑动窗口限制全局、provider、route 或 task-route 范围内的请求数，超限请求等待窗口额度释放，并支持取消等待。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/throttle.ts:63"]}
{"unit_id":"JuwanXu__dsh-camel#feature-3","repo":"JuwanXu/dsh-camel","commit":"fbb445c2e92ad233adbf4ba013fc04ad39ba6996","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-camel 的功能「限流等待与重试」：对配置的 RATE_LIMIT 错误生成重试计划，优先遵循 provider 的 Retry-After，并可设置指数退避、最大本地等待和重试次数上限。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/retry.ts:8"]}
{"unit_id":"JuwanXu__dsh-camel#feature-4","repo":"JuwanXu/dsh-camel","commit":"fbb445c2e92ad233adbf4ba013fc04ad39ba6996","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-camel 的功能「任务级命令控制」：通过可选的 /camel 命令查看状态、设定 JSON 策略、使用预设、暂停或恢复处理、解释当前活动、关闭或重置任务覆盖。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/commands.ts:25"]}
{"unit_id":"JuwanXu__dsh-camel#intent-7","repo":"JuwanXu/dsh-camel","commit":"fbb445c2e92ad233adbf4ba013fc04ad39ba6996","type":"intent","lang":"zh","text":"模型服务返回 Retry-After 时，让 DSH 等指定时间再继续。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/retry.ts:14"]}
